@startuml ManageTime-ManagerApprovalFlow
title Manage Time - Manager Approval Flow

actor Manager as mgr
participant "Email Notification" as email
participant "Intranet Portal" as portal
participant "VTS Application" as vts
participant "VTS Database" as db
participant "Email Service" as emailsvc
actor Employee as emp

mgr -> email: Receive approval notification\nor click link in email
note right of email: Email contains embedded approval link\nor manager navigates manually

mgr -> portal: Navigate to VTS portal
alt Manager authentication required
  portal -> mgr: Request credentials
  mgr -> portal: Provide login credentials
  portal -> vts: Verify authentication
  vts -> vts: Validate manager credentials
else Manager already authenticated
  note right of mgr: Session already active
end

portal -> vts: Redirect to VTS home page

vts -> db: Query manager's own vacation\nrequests & balances
db -> vts: Return manager's vacation data
vts -> vts: Query pending approval requests\nfor manager's subordinates
db -> vts: Return pending VacationRequests
vts -> mgr: Display VTS home page with:\n- Own requests\n- Pending approvals section

mgr -> vts: Select pending request\nto review

vts -> db: Fetch VacationRequest details
db -> vts: Return request details\n(employee, dates, reason, balance info)
vts -> mgr: Display request details\n& approval prompt

mgr -> vts: Review request information
alt Manager Approves Request
  mgr -> vts: Click Approve button
  vts -> vts: Mark request as approved
  vts -> db: Update VacationRequest\n(status: APPROVED, approvedBy: managerId)
  db -> db: Commit approval
  db -> vts: Confirmation
  vts -> emailsvc: Send approval notification
  emailsvc -> emp: Email confirmation to employee
  note right of emp: Employee notified of approval
  
else Manager Denies Request
  mgr -> vts: Click Deny/Reject button
  mgr -> vts: Enter rejection reason
  vts -> vts: Validate rejection reason
  vts -> db: Update VacationRequest\n(status: REJECTED, rejectionReason: text)
  db -> db: Commit rejection
  db -> vts: Confirmation
  vts -> emailsvc: Send rejection notification
  emailsvc -> emp: Email with rejection reason\nto employee
  note right of emp: Employee notified of rejection
end

vts -> db: Update UserVacationBalance\n(if rejected: restore deducted hours)
db -> vts: Balance updated

vts -> mgr: Return to VTS home page
mgr -> vts: May select another request\nto approve or manage\nown vacation time

note right of mgr: Manager can review additional\npending requests or perform\nother VTS actions

@enduml
